Release DLL AdaptivePapyrusBudget 0.3.0 with the shipped INI, Save93, SSE Display Tweaks limiter 30 FPS, no profiler.
Run 1: before the post-load settle and overrun pause; one Update call took about 41 ms in the first minute after load.
Run 2: final build with the 10 s settle after load and the 3 s pause on overruns.

